msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "black_nether_water_nightmares"
#. ~ These should all relate to blindness, darkness, or cold.
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream you are in total darkness with a frigid wind blowing on you, slowly"
" freezing you solid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "black_nether_water_nightmares"
#. ~ These should all relate to blindness, darkness, or cold.
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a normal dream of friends from the old days, but as the dream goes "
"on the color fades until you're dreaming in black and white, and then the "
"light fades until you're in total darkness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "black_nether_water_nightmares"
#. ~ These should all relate to blindness, darkness, or cold.
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of standing on top of a skyscraper and watching a sea of fog cover "
"the city below.  One by one, the lights in the windows go out."
msgstr ""

